Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:10.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys? There's, uh, somebody I'd like you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:10.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位，我希望你们见见一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would be Marcel. You wanna say hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是马塞尔，要打声招呼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he is precious. Where did you get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他好珍贵喔 你从哪里找到他的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My friend Bethel rescued him from some lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我朋友贝瑟 把他从实验室救出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:24.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好残忍喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Why would a parent name their child Bethel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么会有父母亲 把孩子命名为贝瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, that monkey's got a Ross on his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那猴子的屁股上 长了个罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, is he gonna live with you, like, in your apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，他要跟你住在你的公寓吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I mean, it's been kind of quiet since Carol left, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，卡萝离开后 家里冷冷清清的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just get a roommate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么不找个室友就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, I don't know. You reach a certain age...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道，我觉得到了某种年纪…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...having a roommate is just kind of pathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟室友住有点可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, sorry, that's "pathet," which is Sanskrit for "really cool way to live."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，我的意思是说 是很酷的生活方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S01E10: The One with the Monkey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》 第一季 第10集：猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:15.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:19.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:22.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：丽莎·库卓）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马特·勒布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:33.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:48.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys, I'm doing all-new material tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位，我今晚唱的 都是新写的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:54.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have 12 new songs about my mother's suicide...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有十二首有关我母亲自杀的新歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and one about a snowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一首讲的是雪人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Might want to open with the snowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好用雪人那首开场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:02.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: Hey, Joey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，乔伊 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:06.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：亚当·却斯  艾拉·安德里德）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Hey, Joe. - So how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，乔 - 结果怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, I didn't get the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没拿到工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could you not get it? You were Santa last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么可能？ 你是去年的圣诞老公公耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:18.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Some fat guy's sleeping with the store manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:18.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道，某个胖子 跟店经理上床
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：彼得·邦纳兹）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:21.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not even jolly. It's all political.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.83,0:02:21.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他根本无法逗人开心 这就是政治
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are you gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你要当什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna be one of his helpers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会当他的助手之一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:29.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just such a slap in the face, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真是个耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you guys know what you're doing for New Year's?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都知道新年 要做什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gee, what? What is wrong with New Year's?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛 新年有什么问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing for you. You have Paolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是没有，你有巴洛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to face the horrible pressures of this holiday...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不用面对那可怕的节庆压力…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...desperate scramble to find anything with lips...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急须着寻找有嘴唇的生物…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...just so can have somebody to kiss when the ball drops. Man, I'm talking loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在球落下的那一刻 有个可以亲嘴的对象，我真大声
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:52.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, for your information, Paolo's gonna be in Rome this New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:52.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉你，巴洛新年时 人会在罗马
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'll be just as pathetic as the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会跟你们一样可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想得美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just that I'm sick of being a victim of this Dick Clark holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我受够了这个节日的疲劳轰炸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I say this year, no dates, we make a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我提议今年 不要找伴，大家作个约定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just the six of us. Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就我们六个人 一起吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sure. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好啊 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:11.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I was hoping for a little more enthusiasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:11.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望大家的反应 能热烈一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Woo! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Phoebe, you're on. - Oh. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 菲比，轮到你了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, hi. Ladies and gentlemen, back by popular demand...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位，因应观众热烈的要求…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Miss Phoebe Buffay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请大家欢迎菲比布非
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:28.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:28.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, ahem, I want to start with a song that means a lot to me this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:33.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一开始我想先唱首 在这个佳节对我意义重大的歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I made a man with eyes of coal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做了一个人 眼睛是煤炭做的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And a smile so bewitchin'
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有谜样般的微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was I supposed to know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That my mom was dead in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我母亲死在厨房的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}La-la-la
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:58.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:01.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mother's ashes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:01.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我母亲的骨灰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:05.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even her eyelashes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:05.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至是她的睫毛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are resting in a little yellow jar
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安放在一个黄色的小坛子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And sometimes when it's freezing DAVID: I'm being honest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有时天寒地冻 - 我是老实说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:17.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:17.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不同意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I feel a little sneezy MAX: You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我有点想打喷嚏 - 你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now I... Excuse me? Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我… 不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, noisy boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吵闹的男士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:29.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it something that you'd like to share with the group?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:29.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有事情想跟大家分享吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有，没事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:37.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, if it's important enough to discuss while I'm playing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:37.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有事情如此重要 非得在我弹奏时讨论…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then I assume it's important enough for everyone else to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就应该是重要到 值得与大家分享
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That guy's going home with a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙回家后一定会记得这教训
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:51.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Nothing. I was just saying... - Could you speak up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:51.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没事 我只是说… - 可以请你大声点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just saying to my friend, you were the most beautiful woman I'd ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在跟我朋友说 你是我见过最美丽的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:00.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And you said Daryl Hannah... - Darryl Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:00.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你说黛瑞·汉娜… - 黛瑞·汉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:03.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...was the most beautiful woman that he'd ever seen in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:03.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是他看过最美丽的女性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I said, yeah, I liked her in Splash, but not so much in Wall Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说我喜欢她在《美人鱼》的演出 《华尔街》就还好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I thought she had a hard quality. - A hard quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 她有种强硬气质 - 强硬特质
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, uh, while Daryl Hannah is beautiful in a conventional way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}黛瑞·汉娜是传统的美…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:18.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you are, uh, luminous with a kind of delicate grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:18.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你则是散发出高雅的气质
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:24.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then that's when you started yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:24.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后你就开始大吼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we're gonna take a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我们休息片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:41.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think that guy's going home with more than a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:41.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙带回家的 应该不只是教训而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Come here, Marcel. Sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来，．马塞尔，坐着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, I can't believe he hasn't kissed you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，我不敢相信 他还没亲你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, God, by my sixth date with Paolo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟巴洛约会六次后…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:00.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I mean, he had already named both my breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:00.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他已经替我的胸部取小名了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, did I just share too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是不是说太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a smidge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:13.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}David's, like, you know, a scientist guy. He's very methodical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:13.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大卫是个科学家 做事一丝不苟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I think it's romantic. - Me too. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我觉得很浪漫 - 我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you ever see An Officer and a Gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有没有看过《军官与绅士》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:19.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:19.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, he's kind of like the guy I went to see that with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他就像陪我去看那部电影的男生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:27.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Except...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:27.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:32.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Except he's smarter and gentler and sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:32.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他更聪明、温柔而且贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just... I just want to be with him all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想一直和他在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:39.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, day and night. And night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:39.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}日以继夜 夜以继日
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:42.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And special occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:42.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}特殊节日也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. I see where this is going. You're gonna ask him to New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，我懂了 你要邀他共度新年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:50.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna break the pact. She's gonna break the pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:50.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要毁约 抛弃我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:55.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, could I just?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:55.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有啦，我可以吗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, because I already asked Janice. RACHEL: You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 可以，因为我已经邀了珍妮丝 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:02.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, this was a pact. This was your pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:02.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样，这是你订的约定耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I snapped, okay? I couldn't handle the pressure and I snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我耐不住，我毁约了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:08.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but Janice? That was, like, the worst breakup in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:08.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是珍妮丝？ 你们的分手糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not saying it was a good idea. I'm saying I snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是说这是好主意 我只是毁约了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:16.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Hi, sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:16.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:27.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too many jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:27.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太多笑话了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Must mock Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定要取笑乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:34.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice shoes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:34.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒的鞋子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aah, you're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我快笑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross. He's playing with my spatulas again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，他又在玩我的锅铲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, he's not gonna hurt them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不会伤害它们 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:47.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you always have to bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:47.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定要把他 带来这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I didn't want to leave him alone, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想把他单独留在家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We had our first fight this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今早吵了第一次架
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:08:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it has to do with my working late. I said some things that I didn't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:08:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得是因为我加班的关系 我说了不该说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:04.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He threw some feces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:04.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他就朝我扔一坨屎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:10.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, if you're gonna work late, I can look in on him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:10.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你加班 我可以替你照顾他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that would be great. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了，好…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:16.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you do, make sure it seems like you're there to see him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:16.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你去，一定要假装 你是去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:18.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're not, like, doing it as a favor to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:18.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而不是帮我忙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:22.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. But if he asks, I'm not going to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:22.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，但是他如果问 我就要直话直说了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you can't actually test this theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们仍无法测试这个理论
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:34.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because today's particle accelerators are nowhere near powerful enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:34.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为现今粒子加速器的速度…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to simulate these conditions.
