Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. All right. I have a question then. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好，那我有个问题 - 请说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Were you planning on kissing me ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有打算要亲我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:49.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, that's definitely a valid question...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:49.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常合理的问题…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and, uh, the answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}答案是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would be yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有这个打算
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:03.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But see, I wanted it to be this phenomenal kiss...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:03.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我要这非凡的吻…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that happened at this phenomenal moment because, well, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生在非凡的时刻 因为是要亲你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:07.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:07.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:12.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. But, see, the longer I waited, the more phenomenal the kiss had to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:12.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，但是我等得愈久 这个亲吻得更加非凡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now, we've reached a place...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在，已经变成…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where it's just got to be one of those things where I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:19.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sweep everything off the table and throw you down on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:19.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把桌子的东西都扫光 把你丢上去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm not really a sweeping sort of fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我并不是那样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:27.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, David, I think you are a sweeping sort of fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大卫，我认为你正是那样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:31.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you're a sweeper trapped inside a physicist's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:31.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是你困在物理学家的体内罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really. - Oh, yeah. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是吗 - 没错 我很肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should just do it. Just sweep and throw me. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就来吧，扫掉一切 把我丢上去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:42.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Now? Now? - Right now. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:42.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 现在做吗  - 就是现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:44.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:44.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:50.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? This is just really expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:50.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，这个很贵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. And I'll tell you, this was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，这个是礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So now you're just kind of tidying up. - Okay, what the hell? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你现在比较像在打扫 - 好吧，管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:05.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You want me to actually throw you...? - I can hop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:05.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你要我把你丢上去还是你自己跳  - 我可以跳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:25.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, tell me something, what does the phase "no-date pact" mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:25.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我，〝没有约会的约定〞 对你们的意义为何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很抱歉，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just that Chandler has somebody and Phoebe has somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是钱德约了人 菲比也约了人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:31.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought I'd ask Fun Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:31.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就想说问问好笑巴比
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Fun Bobby, your ex-boyfriend, Fun Bobby? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你的前男友 好笑巴比 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know more than one Fun Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还知道第二个好笑巴比吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:38.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I happen to know a Fun Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:38.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚好还认识一个好笑巴伯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa, whoa, whoa. There's no room for milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有空间加牛奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There. Now there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了，现在有了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so on our no-date evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，在没有约会的夜晚…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...three of you now are gonna have dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三个人都有约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Uh, four. - Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 四个 - 四个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Five. - Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 五个 - 五个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:03.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry. Paolo's catching an earlier flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:03.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，巴洛要搭早一点的班机回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:07.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and I met this really hot single mom at the store. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:07.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在店里遇见一位很辣的单亲妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's an elf to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然小精灵还能做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:13.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so I'm gonna be the only one standing there alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:13.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以球落下的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:14.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when the ball drops?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:14.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有我会孤单一人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:19.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on. We'll have a big party, and no one will know who's with who.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:19.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样，我们会办个大派对 没有人会知道谁的伴是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know, this is so not what I needed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在真的不需要应付这些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's the matter? - Oh, it's Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了 - 噢，是马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He keeps shutting me out, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一直拒我于门外
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:32.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's walking around all the time, dragging his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老是拖着双手，走来走去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:36.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's so weird. I had such a blast with him the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:36.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太奇怪了，我前几晚 跟他玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - Yeah, we played. We watched TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是吗？ - 是啊，我们一起玩，还看电视
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:41.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That juggling thing is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:41.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杂耍那部分实在太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:46.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What juggling thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:46.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么杂耍？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:49.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With the balled-up socks? I figured you taught him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:49.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿袜子当球耍啊 我以为是你教的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:55.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it wasn't that big a deal. I mean, just balled-up socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:55.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实没什么大不了的 只是袜子球而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And a melon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和一颗香瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Phoebe. Hi. - Hi, Max. Do you know everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 菲比，你好 - 嗨，麦克斯，你认识大家了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Have you seen David?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不认识，你有看到大卫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:08.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he hasn't been around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:08.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有，他不在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if you see him, tell him to pack his bags. We are going to Minsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果看到他 叫他打包，我们要去明斯克了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:15.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Minsk? - Minsk. It's in Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:15.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 明斯克  - 明斯克在俄罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know where Minsk is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道明斯克在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha, ha. We got the grant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们拿到奖助金
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three years, all expenses paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全额赞助我们三年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:26.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So when do you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:26.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们什么时候走
