Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一月一号
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:43.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. Hi. Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:43.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:47.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you doing here? - Um, well, Max told me about Minsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:47.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你怎么来了  - 麦克斯跟我说了明斯克的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you know, congratulations. This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是来恭喜你的 实在太令人兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:52.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MAX: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:52.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'd be even more exciting, if we were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们要去 就更兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:58.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're not going? Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:58.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不去吗 为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell her, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟她说啊，大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:03.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I don't want to go to Minsk to work with Lipson and Yamaguchi and Flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:03.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我不想去明斯克 和李波森、山口及法兰克工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:08.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. I want to stay here and make out with my girlfriend."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:08.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我想留在这里 和我的女友亲热〞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:11.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, thank you, Max. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:11.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，谢谢你，麦克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:14.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you're really not going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:14.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你真的不去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:17.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I don't know what I'm gonna do. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:17.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道，我不知道怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:19.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:19.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由你决定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.99,0:13:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, don't do that. - Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.99,0:13:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 别这样 - 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but I'm asking you. I can't make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在问你 我无法做决定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I can't. Please, just... - Okay. Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我无法，拜托你… - 好，留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Stay. - Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 留下来 - 留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Getting so good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你愈来愈厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was Max's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都是麦克斯的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love this artichoke thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢菊芋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:58.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, don't tell me what's in it. The diet starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:58.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要告诉我里面有什么 我明天才开始节食
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:04.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You remember Janice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:04.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还记得珍妮丝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Vividly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}历历在目
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Hi. - Hi, I'm Sandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嗨，我是珊蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sandy, hi. Come on in. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}珊蒂，嗨，进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:29.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:29.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You brought your kids. - Yeah. That's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:32.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你把孩子带来了 - 对，可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轰趴了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That thing is not coming in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个东西不能进来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:43.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"That thing"? This is how you greet guests at a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:43.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝那个东西〞  你是这样接待客人的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me ask you something. If I showed up with my new girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我问问你 如果我是和我的新女友来…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she wouldn't be welcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她在这里也会不受欢迎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm thinking your new girlfriend wouldn't urinate on my coffee table.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是你的新女友 不会在我的茶几洒尿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was more embarrassed about that than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这件事情，他比任何人 都感到丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:15:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay? And for him to have the courage to walk back in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:15:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？他有这样的勇气 回到这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:03.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...like nothing happened...
